WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:04.413
This video shows how to set up book categories on a phone.

00:00:06.069 --> 00:00:13.125
Tap the menu button, open Library and choose Catalog. Then tap Manage Categories.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:28.868
Type the category name, Reference, and a short description, Dictionaries, atlases and encyclopedias.

00:00:36.131 --> 00:00:44.123
Tap Add Category. A message confirms it, and the new category appears in the Existing Categories list.

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:57.161
Tap Edit next to a category, for example History. Change its description and tap Save Changes.

00:01:07.418 --> 00:01:14.546
Tap Done to close the window. The catalog behind it is ready, with the categories in its filter.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:25.886
The categories are ready and appear in the catalog filter and the Add Book form.
